      "todoList": false,
      "createsAggregate": false,
      "elementCopy": false,
      "sketched": false,
      "comments": [
        "Where does RestaurantId actually come from on this form?\n\nIt is currently mapped `session:RestaurantId`, but a guest has no account and no login — the whole cancel-by-code design exists precisely because there is no authenticated session. So \"session\" is very likely the wrong origin.\n\nThe realistic source is whichever restaurant's page the guest is booking from, i.e. a route/URL parameter rather than session state. Everything downstream depends on this being right: RestaurantId scopes the Active Reservations list, and it is carried on Cancel Reservation.\n\nThis is the only field in the chapter whose origin is asserted rather than traced. Please confirm the real source before this feeds code generation."
      ]
    }
